From 804096542308fbbcb1ea26fe79f297f834f45b2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 21:29:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 186/189] Patch 0186: training block. R2 in a gym session
 switches x1 / x5 (MOD_TRAIN_BLOCK; a plate shows it; never with Bonus Try). A
 block plays the first session's animation, then runs the gym's award once per
 session, each with its hour and care costs and the gains of one in the stats
 before the next, and stops after the session that left the partner hungry,
 needing the toilet, sleepy, tired, unwell, due to digivolve, at the end of
 its life, or that opened the gym's own box; the stats box shows the total and
 a box under it the sessions done and why it stopped (text/trn, text/trn2).
 The battle and evolution plates and the stop check move to src/main/mod_qol.c

